OL,3,GNEWSAMilton Keynes expansion gets #50m
OL,4,Afor road links
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilton Keynes is to receive #50m to
OL,7,Fimprove road links supporting the
OL,8,Fcity's expansion.
OL,10,FThe city council said the money would
OL,11,Fhelp unlock 5,500 homes and that new
OL,12,Froads would also improve access to land
OL,13,Fearmarked for future growth.
OL,15,FThe leader of the council said the
OL,16,Fmoney would help ensure infrastructure
OL,17,Fwas "provided alongside new homes, not
OL,18,Fyears afterwards".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
