OL,3,GNEWSAMilton Keynes expansion gets #50m
OL,4,Afor road links
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project has already received #94.6m
OL,7,Ffrom the government's Housing
OL,8,FInfrastructure Fund, which has funded a
OL,9,Fprimary school, road improvements and a
OL,10,Fcommunity health hub.
